<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - United Waste upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns analyst Melissa White said she raised her rating on United Waste Systems Inc because she sees upside in the stock.</p>
<p>-- upgraded to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- raised the earnings estimate to $1.50 per share from $1.48 for 1997, and to $1.95 from $1.85 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- also cited acquisition prospects as well as increasing assumptions for profitability.</p>
<p>-- said company did better last year than she expected due to improved control of sales, general and administrative expenses.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 1/2 to 39-3/4.</p>
</text>
